 respectively <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\\in v_1\">\\(v_0\\in v_1\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}(v_0)=\\omega\">\\(\\operatorname{cf}(v_0)=\\omega\\)</span>, and “<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle v_0,v_1\\rangle\">\\(\\langle v_0,v_1\\rangle\\)</span> preserves stationary subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_2\">\\(v_2\\)</span>”</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ForcingIterationSystem}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ForcingIterationSystem}_S\\)</span>, and the six-place <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\)</span> are the registered predicates from the dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RCSCondition}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RCSCondition}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RCSIterationSystem}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RCSIterationSystem}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingStationarySetPreservingIteration}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingStationarySetPreservingIteration}_S\\)</span> are defined here</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}rcs\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RCSCondition}_S(p,\\lambda;M,P_\\bullet,\\dot Q_\\bullet,\\leq_\\bullet)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(p,\\operatorname{dom}(p),\\operatorname{ran}(p))\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\subseteq\\lambda\n\\land|\\operatorname{dom}(p)|\\leq\\aleph_0\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;\\Bigl(\np\\upharpoonright\\alpha\\in P_\\bullet(\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\!\\left(\nM,p\\upharpoonright\\alpha,\\varphi_{\\in},\n\\langle p(\\alpha),\\dot Q_\\bullet(\\alpha)\\rangle,\nP_\\bullet(\\alpha),\\leq_\\bullet(\\alpha)\n\\right)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\lambda\\cup\\{\\lambda\\}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\beta)\\land\\beta\\neq0\n\\land\\sup(\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\cap\\beta)=\\beta\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{48mm}\\to\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\!\\left(\nM,p\\upharpoonright\\beta,\\varphi_{\\mathrm{cf}\\omega},\n\\langle\\check\\beta\\rangle,P_\\bullet(\\beta),\\leq_\\bullet(\\beta)\n\\right)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}rcs\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RCSCondition}_S(p,\\lambda;M,P_\\bullet,\\dot Q_\\bullet,\\leq_\\bullet)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(p,\\operatorname{dom}(p),\\operatorname{ran}(p))\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\subseteq\\lambda\n\\land|\\operatorname{dom}(p)|\\leq\\aleph_0\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\;\\Bigl(\np\\upharpoonright\\alpha\\in P_\\bullet(\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\!\\left(\nM,p\\upharpoonright\\alpha,\\varphi_{\\in},\n\\langle p(\\alpha),\\dot Q_\\bullet(\\alpha)\\rangle,\nP_\\bullet(\\alpha),\\leq_\\bullet(\\alpha)\n\\right)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\lambda\\cup\\{\\lambda\\}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\beta)\\land\\beta\\neq0\n\\land\\sup(\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\cap\\beta)=\\beta\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{48mm}\\to\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\!\\left(\nM,p\\upharpoonright\\beta,\\varphi_{\\mathrm{cf}\\omega},\n\\langle\\check\\beta\\rangle,P_\\bullet(\\beta),\\leq_\\bullet(\\beta)\n\\right)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}rcs\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RCSIterationSystem}_S(\\vec I,\\delta,M,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists P_\\bullet,\\dot Q_\\bullet,\\dot{\\leq}_\\bullet,\\leq_\\bullet,1_\\bullet,\n\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit}\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\vec I=\\langle P_\\bullet,\\dot Q_\\bullet,\\dot{\\leq}_\\bullet,\n\\leq_\\bullet,1_\\bullet,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ForcingIterationSystem}_S(P_\\bullet,\\dot Q_\\bullet,\\delta,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\dot{\\leq}_\\bullet,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\dot{\\leq}_\\bullet))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\leq_\\bullet,\\delta\\cup\\{\\delta\\},\\operatorname{ran}(\\leq_\\bullet))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(1_\\bullet,\\delta\\cup\\{\\delta\\},\\operatorname{ran}(1_\\bullet))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\cup\\{\\delta\\}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P_\\bullet(\\alpha),\\leq_\\bullet(\\alpha))\n\\land1_\\bullet(\\alpha)\\in P_\\bullet(\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{51mm}\\land\\forall p\\in P_\\bullet(\\alpha)\\;\n\\langle p,1_\\bullet(\\alpha)\\rangle\\in\\leq_\\bullet(\\alpha)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\Sigma=\\Bigl\\{\\langle\\lambda,p\\rangle:\\lambda\\in\\delta\\cup\\{\\delta\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda\\neq0\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{43mm}\\land\\mathrm{RCSCondition}_S\n(p,\\lambda;M,P_\\bullet,\\dot Q_\\bullet,\\leq_\\bullet)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\delta\\cup\\{\\delta\\}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda\\neq0\n\\to P_\\bullet(\\lambda)=\\{p\\in V:\\langle\\lambda,p\\rangle\\in\\Sigma\\}\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}rcs\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RCSIterationSystem}_S(\\vec I,\\delta,M,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists P_\\bullet,\\dot Q_\\bullet,\\dot{\\leq}_\\bullet,\\leq_\\bullet,1_\\bullet,\n\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit}\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\vec I=\\langle P_\\bullet,\\dot Q_\\bullet,\\dot{\\leq}_\\bullet,\n\\leq_\\bullet,1_\\bullet,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ForcingIterationSystem}_S(P_\\bullet,\\dot Q_\\bullet,\\delta,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\dot{\\leq}_\\bullet,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\dot{\\leq}_\\bullet))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\leq_\\bullet,\\delta\\cup\\{\\delta\\},\\operatorname{ran}(\\leq_\\bullet))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(1_\\bullet,\\delta\\cup\\{\\delta\\},\\operatorname{ran}(1_\\bullet))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\cup\\{\\delta\\}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P_\\bullet(\\alpha),\\leq_\\bullet(\\alpha))\n\\land1_\\bullet(\\alpha)\\in P_\\bullet(\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{51mm}\\land\\forall p\\in P_\\bullet(\\alpha)\\;\n\\langle p,1_\\bullet(\\alpha)\\rangle\\in\\leq_\\bullet(\\alpha)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\Sigma=\\Bigl\\{\\langle\\lambda,p\\rangle:\\lambda\\in\\delta\\cup\\{\\delta\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda\\neq0\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{43mm}\\land\\mathrm{RCSCondition}_S\n(p,\\lambda;M,P_\\bullet,\\dot Q_\\bullet,\\leq_\\bullet)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\delta\\cup\\{\\delta\\}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda\\neq0\n\\to P_\\bullet(\\lambda)=\\{p\\in V:\\langle\\lambda,p\\rangle\\in\\Sigma\\}\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label