ppa\\rangle,\nP_\\bullet(\\alpha),\\leq_\\bullet(\\alpha)\n\\right)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The support convention and every stage order are part of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec I\">\\(\\vec I\\)</span>.  At a limit, the stage carrier is exactly the set of countable-support conditions satisfying the revision clause at every unbounded support initial segment.</li>\n<li>The stage-preservation judgment uses a genuine three-variable formula code and the matching three-name tuple; the former formula displayed three semantic arguments but supplied only two names.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"911508dbd8495663","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-forcing-stationary-set-preserving-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"1cd156e08cdc8ce0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-forcing-stationary-set-preserving-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration-system.md","status":"resolved","id":"39a84ca5e